ents of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 6 \\\\ \\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}4 & 6 \\\\ \\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =4\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}-6\\cdot \\frac{1}{3} \\\\  & =2-2 \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,0\\,|=0\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13956518/state.json" "file_sha256" "9ec084eec6c9aa6624842d78db1774daef378db09bd606aea5a93a0b72890d48" "basis" 647 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13956518/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-69943" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13956518/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "c2fd1b7355fa6c287086552bf692aa77ee3f50f827fa5efe6bbbbfbe23883039" "basis" 647 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13956518/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-69943" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13956518/state.json" "file_sha256" "9ec084eec6c9aa6624842d78db1774daef378db09bd606aea5a93a0b72890d48" "basis" 647 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13956518/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-69943" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "0"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13956518/state.json" "file_sha256" "9ec084eec6c9aa6624842d78d